WEBVTT

00:09:27.737 --> 00:09:32.040
such as racism, poverty, education,
segregated housing,

00:09:32.064 --> 00:09:33.963
contribute to these disparities.

00:09:34.419 --> 00:09:38.504
But Shalon's story highlights
an additional underlying cause:

00:09:38.528 --> 00:09:40.003
quality of care.

00:09:40.027 --> 00:09:43.043
Lack of standards in postpartum care.

00:09:43.067 --> 00:09:46.355
Shalon was seen multiple times
by clinicians in those three weeks,

00:09:46.379 --> 00:09:48.276
and she still died.

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:51.001
Quality of care
in the setting of childbirth

00:09:51.025 --> 00:09:54.268
is an underlying cause
of racial and ethnic disparities

00:09:54.292 --> 00:09:57.110
in maternal mortality
and severe maternal morbidity

00:09:57.134 --> 00:09:58.306
in the United States,

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:00.608
and it's something we can address now.